WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.160
Okay, we're back to our meditations. Now

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.960
remember we're doing an act of truth
meditation.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:19.680
Okay, and don't forget what that means. We are... in ancient india...

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.519
I remember for example, the Buddha
might say something like this...

00:00:23.519 --> 00:00:27.519
the Buddha had a half-brother Devadatta
who was very

00:00:27.519 --> 00:00:32.960
jealous of him, and i remember
there's a story where he--Devadatta--

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:38.079
gets sick
and Lord Buddha tries to put his hand on

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:42.879
his head to measure his temperature,
and Devadatta is so jealous of the

00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:46.640
Buddha that he gets angry and he says,
"Take your hand off me".

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.559
"You're trying to hurt me... you're
doing voodoo on me."

00:00:50.559 --> 00:00:53.840
And then lord Buddha says, "Look, I wasn't
doing voodoo i was trying to help you."

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.399
And Devadatta said, "no no you

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:58.559
weren't trying to help me" and then
Buddha says

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:04.239
"Look, let's do the act of truth thing
okay?" And Devadatta is like "what's

00:01:04.239 --> 00:01:06.640
an act of truth?"
And he says, "Look over here is the

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.159
Ganges river..."
If you've ever been to the Ganges river

00:01:10.159 --> 00:01:15.200
i mean it's unbelievable...
if you're in a train it might take

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.799
an hour to cross the ganges on a bridge,
it's unbelievable.

00:01:18.799 --> 00:01:22.799
It's a unbelievable huge river, beautiful
river.

00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:30.079
And... so buddha says to his
half-brother, "Look, let's do an act of

00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:32.080
truth."

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.400
"If I was trying to help you and not hurt

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.720
you, then may the Ganges river float

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.720
backwards right now!" And then the Ganges river will

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:44.320
go...
and then it will start to flow backwards

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:49.680
you know, back to the Himalayas.
Back up to the Himalayas you know, and

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.720
i like to think of... we have a big
waterfall here in America

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:58.640
called Niagara Falls. So just imagine
thousands of tons of water going

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.960
backwards,
that's called an act of truth. And it's a

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:05.840
tradition in our lineage.In our
tradition it's a tradition

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:11.200
to do an act of truth, so what kind of
act of truth are we going to do here?

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:15.280
We have something going on with the
virus. Of course the virus is hurting

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.440
people,
making people sick, killing people.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.480
But aside from the virus, we have a huge
amount of fear

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:28.480
right now, and i don't mean ...
there's rioting in the streets, there was

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.720
a little bit, but i don't mean everyone
is like screaming or something like that.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:38.400
But there's sort of a
a deep silent fear of what's going on. We

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.200
don't know how long it's going to be. We
don't know how long it's going to go on for.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.360
We don't know what's going to happen to

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:48.840
our family; to our job.
There's sort of a deep undercurrent of

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:53.040
fear going on in our societies, all of our

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.840
societies right now.
So let's try to send that fear

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.080
to the middle of the sun. Let's destroy
that fear okay? We're going to do an act of truth 

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:06.800
okay? We're going to do an act of truth:

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:13.840
If it's true that during the virus
i tried to comfort one person okay...

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.680
I don't know... your mom, or your kids, or
your dog.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.280
My dog was getting nervous. He didn't
know what was going on,

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:25.360
but he was uncomfortable, you could see
he was nervous.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:29.120
He felt something going on with the humans,

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.120
and then i would pet him and give him
some snacks and you know...

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.319
try to make him feel better. So in my
case it's true

00:03:38.319 --> 00:03:41.920
that during the virus I have done at
least

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:47.280
one small thing to calm
somebody else down, you know? It happened

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.159
to be my dog okay?
Because I only had two people in my

00:03:50.159 --> 00:03:53.680
house. Me, and veronica, and the dogs
okay?

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:59.599
Veronica doesn't get scared, the dog was
nervous, so I was just trying to help

00:03:59.599 --> 00:04:04.319
the dog. So it is true
that i did this one good thing, so i have

00:04:04.319 --> 00:04:08.400
the raw material
for an act of truth you know? We've been

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:12.229
calling it the "bullet
in the gun" you know?

00:04:12.229 --> 00:04:13.360
Like i have a...

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:17.759
I have some raw materials, so your job
during this meditation

00:04:17.759 --> 00:04:25.680
is going to be to do an act of truth;
we are going to shoot a bullet

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:29.360
into the fear that everybody has. We're
going to try to send it to the middle of

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.600
the sun.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.600
25 million degrees. Burned up

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.390
in the middle of the sun okay?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.120
We're going to try to do that.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.740
And to do that... you're going to have to

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.360
remember something you did during the

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.540
virus times...

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.040
the time of the virus, to help someone

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.940
else who was nervous or scared

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.440
okay?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:50.960
And then you're going to do an act of

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:51.460
truth:

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.699
"if it's true

00:04:52.699 --> 00:04:56.320
that I helped one other person who was

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.811
nervous or scared

00:04:57.811 --> 00:05:00.880
during this virus, then may the

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.645
virus be
killed by my act of truth."

00:05:03.645 --> 00:05:04.720
"May i send the

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.600
virus to the middle of the sun and destroy it." 

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.240
Okay?

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:08.880
And I

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.800
think it'd be really...

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:12.880
cool, i mean i don't know if we will have

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.820
the strength or the wisdom to do it,

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:18.960
but it would be cool if

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.400
our if our meditations could stop the
virus.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.560
That would be really

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.520
amazing.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.479
i don't know if we're good
enough to do it,

00:05:26.479 --> 00:05:29.900
but it would be it's certainly worth a
try right?

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:30.800
It's certainly

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.980
something cool to try, so let's try.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:38.639
And as we go through...

00:05:38.639 --> 00:05:43.360
After we identify that good thing you
did,

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.893
we're going to send it... to help
different people.

00:05:47.893 --> 00:05:49.759
And there's a list of

00:05:49.759 --> 00:05:53.266
19 different things that hurt
people okay?

00:05:53.266 --> 00:05:55.520
We already took care of the

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.362
hell beings.

00:05:56.362 --> 00:05:57.977
We covered the animals,

00:05:57.977 --> 00:05:58.960
we covered the

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.920
pretas--the hungry ghosts.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.759
And now in this meditation we're going

00:06:03.759 --> 00:06:05.460
to help out the human beings okay?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.160
We're going to do

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.040
something for human beings,

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:12.639
and i think if you listen to the recording that we

00:06:12.639 --> 00:06:15.148
did of the dedication chapter,

00:06:15.148 --> 00:06:16.319
this is one of

00:06:16.319 --> 00:06:19.839
the most beautiful
pieces of spiritual poetry ever.

00:06:19.839 --> 00:06:22.000
And

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:29.919
how master shantideva imagines
walking across the planet,

00:06:29.919 --> 00:06:34.720
and helping all kinds of different
people with different problems okay?

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.600
So let's get started.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.360
Please sit up straight.

00:06:41.039 --> 00:06:49.840
Okay, drink something.

00:06:51.199 --> 00:06:56.880
I like left hand down, right hand down on
top.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:01.360
I kind of let my thumbs... I don't try to
do this like the Buddha does

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.640
because I get distracted trying to keep them up.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:07.520
So i just let them fall down.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:11.220
Sit up super straight.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.080
And let's come to our breath. We're just

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:22.000
going to do 15 minutes, it's not a long
meditation.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.720
Make it a make it a really good 15 minutes.

00:07:32.639 --> 00:07:37.039
Let's watch our breath. 10 long exhales.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:45.840
You can link it to your heartbeat, it's
it's kind of more fun.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:01.760
Now try to identify sometime during the
last few months--

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:08.399
during the time of the virus--
when you broke out of your shell

00:09:08.399 --> 00:09:11.519
of self-concern.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:18.959
You noticed that someone else was afraid,
and you tried to make them feel better.

00:09:18.959 --> 00:09:26.320
You tried to make them feel safer.
Here we go. Don't... and then keep that in

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.839
mind, we're going to use it for an act of

00:09:34.839 --> 00:09:37.839
truth.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:43.360
Now let's use that act of truth like a
bullet.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:50.959
And we transform--
we imagine that we are Manjushri.

00:10:50.959 --> 00:10:58.959
We are like this incredibly beautiful
divine Buddha,

00:10:58.959 --> 00:11:03.600
and we are walking through the world--
this virus world--

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.800
and we are touching people.

00:11:06.959 --> 00:11:11.040
First we meet people who are blind,

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:16.720
probably in your life you've known a few
blind people.

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:23.519
And like in the stories of Jesus, we
touch their eyes

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:28.000
and then suddenly they're able to see.
Imagine that.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:35.760
"If it's true
that i helped a person who was afraid

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:38.880
during the last few months,

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:43.600
then may all the blind people in this
world see see things."

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.040
"Right now, in this moment."

00:11:47.519 --> 00:11:51.360
"May the Ganges river flow backwards."

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:57.839
"May blind people see."

00:12:02.959 --> 00:12:06.240
"May deaf people hear."

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:13.600
"I do an act of truth, if it's true I was
kind to someone who was afraid... if I made

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:17.920
them feel better...
may all the deaf people in this world

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:22.800
hear suddenly." "Hear
all the beautiful sounds of this world

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:27.839
the birds,
music,

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:39.839
loving words of other people."

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:49.440
"If it's true that I helped a person in
the virus times,

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:56.560
by that good karma
may Manjushri appear to every woman

00:12:56.560 --> 00:13:01.360
right now who is in labor, who is about
to have a baby,

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:09.200
suffering that extraordinary pain, and
ready to make that final sacrifice

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.800
to give life to another being."

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:19.680
"If it's true I tried to help someone,
then may every one of those women have a

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:35.839
very easy easy childbirth--
painless like the Buddha's mother did."

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:41.120
There are people in the world who have
no... they're so poor they don't even have

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:46.800
a shirt, or
they don't have clothes. And i have seen

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:51.680
in my life, in my travels, I've seen these
people.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:59.199
"And may they suddenly--through my
act of truth--may they have beautiful

00:13:59.199 --> 00:14:17.839
soft sturdy clothing
to protect them."

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.440
"If it's true that i helped someone in the [time of the] virus, then may all the people in this

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:26.480
world who are hungry,
at this moment they cannot get food,

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:31.120
there's no way they can get food, then
may they

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:37.760
be filled." "May food suddenly come to them
and made they be filled." When I first went

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:42.839
to India...
I saw a man on his hands and knees eating

00:14:42.839 --> 00:14:46.959
grass like a
animal.

00:14:48.959 --> 00:14:52.560
And so there are people like that, there
is hunger like that,

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:59.839
especially now.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.360
There are many many people in the world
who have lost all their money.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:11.680
I spoke to some of the monks at the
monastery this morning,

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:19.360
and in India it's happening... there
there are people with no money at all.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:26.000
They had a little bit... I have met
farm workers in the fields around

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.480
the monastery who who have one piece of
bread

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.759
and that's all they own. And those people
are

00:15:33.759 --> 00:15:38.639
in need of money, may they suddenly have

00:15:38.839 --> 00:15:41.839
money.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:49.600
We all know people who have lost people
they love...

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:56.560
and they are grieving and sometimes
grief takes years, sometimes grief can

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:03.120
take 10 years, 20 years.
So may those people, by my act of truth,

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:09.839
may they suddenly finish with their
grieving. May they find comfort.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:19.120
There are people who have lost hope. They see no hope for the future.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:24.560
They don't even want to get out of bed,
they don't talk much,

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:30.240
they don't do much, they sit at home and
they feel despair.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:37.839
"May I, by my act of truth,
may those people feel hope."

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:48.720
Next in this chapter Shantideva... Master
Shantideva talks about people who are sick,

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:53.279
and of course there are tens of
thousands... hundreds of thousands of

00:16:53.279 --> 00:17:00.480
people are sick right now.
"And by my act of truth,

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:04.480
may their sickness finish; may they start
to feel

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:08.000
very comfortable and very healthy."

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:20.079
Next is fear. There are people... of course
there are

00:17:20.799 --> 00:17:26.160
millions of people right now in fear.
"And may my act of truth remove that fear."

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:32.880
Virus is
difficult, virus is deadly, but the fear

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:47.840
on top of the virus it's almost worse
than the virus.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.440
Next Master Shantideva says, "let's do
an act of truth

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:59.679
on all those people who have no power in
society". They are un-empowered.

00:17:59.679 --> 00:18:03.360
Other people boss them around, other
people tell them what to do.

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:11.360
Most often because of race, or religion,
or beliefs... they are

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:18.720
un-empowered in our society.
And by this act of truth,

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:24.799
may people who for those reasons have
have no authority or no power in this

00:18:24.799 --> 00:18:32.000
society, may they suddenly
come to full power.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:41.280
Even in the time of the virus there
are

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:48.160
countless people on the road, flying...
still some airplanes are going.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.400
More and more people are driving; people
are trying to get home. People in India

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:57.919
are walking home,
for a thousand miles to get home

00:18:57.919 --> 00:19:05.919
during the virus. May each person
who is on the way home---may my

00:19:05.919 --> 00:19:10.080
act of truth---may my good karma help them on their way. May they have a smooth

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:14.720
trip, and an easy trip.

00:19:21.919 --> 00:19:25.360
Then there are countless people who they are not traveling because they have 

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.679
nowhere  to go...

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:33.520
they don't have a home, they don't have
relatives, they don't have a family.

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:41.440
There's nowhere they can go for help.
And i do my act of truth for them.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:50.240
I do my act of truth for children, small
children.

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:55.600
They are especially vulnerable. People
take advantage of them, people hurt them,

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:59.919
people ignore them, people don't take
care of them...

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.480
and by this act of truth may all
children...

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:09.120
may all young children in this world be
protected,

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:21.840
and happy, and have a beautiful childhood.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.640
The elderly are very similar to the
children.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.799
They are... they used to be strong, they
used to be like you and me,

00:20:30.799 --> 00:20:37.679
and their only sin is that they got old
and they don't have the energy to work,

00:20:37.679 --> 00:20:42.240
to make money anymore. They don't have
the energy to do the

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:47.679
little day-to-day things they used to do
in their home; they can't cook anymore,

00:20:47.679 --> 00:20:52.480
they can't make the bed anymore, they
can't walk to the toilet anymore.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:56.640
Like small children, they are very
vulnerable.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:21:03.200
And may my act of truth make them strong and protected.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:08.799
Three more and then we're done with the
meditation.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:16.720
And it's so beautiful that Shantideva
identifies the really major problems of

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.919
this world. He says there are
millions of people who had trouble

00:21:19.919 --> 00:21:24.720
sleeping last night,
maybe you have this problem. I know I

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:28.960
have it sometimes.
And we just can't sleep, we wake up in

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:32.240
the middle of the night, we stare

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:40.640
at in the darkness and we worry.
So may... through this act of truth,

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:45.840
may all people who have trouble sleeping,
may they sleep well tonight.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:55.200
People who are mentally
troubled. They're mentally

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:59.840
broken. There's a lot of, for example in
America, a lot of veterans

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:07.520
of fighting--ex-soldiers--
who have this problem, and their minds

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:13.039
are troubled; they're not quite normal.

00:22:13.039 --> 00:22:16.559
I do an act of truth for you.

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:22.000
And then finally says Shantideva, there
are people who are just

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:31.520
completely crazy. They are locked up
in a hospital, they are given heavy drugs,

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:36.400
they are wasting away, locked up in a
room.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:42.559
I had a friend whose relative got Covid
and died from it.

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.679
And the irony is she was already locked
up,

00:22:47.679 --> 00:22:55.600
in a mental asylum for over 30 years,
and then inside there she dies from this

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.919
virus.

00:22:58.480 --> 00:23:02.080
So i also pray for these people.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:07.200
I send my act of truth to them

00:23:07.679 --> 00:23:23.840
as if i were Manjushri.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:37.840
Let's come back to our breath. Three deep
breaths, three deep exhales.

00:23:48.159 --> 00:23:55.039
And slowly open your eyes. Take a stretch.
I like to take a stretch.

00:23:55.279 --> 00:24:01.279
We're going to do five meditations total,
and that's the second one. And please do

00:24:01.279 --> 00:24:04.080
it this week, try to do it once or twice
a day.

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:19.760
It's very short and it's very beautiful.
See you for the next one.

